    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>HC</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub></math></p><p>On adding equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>. So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>.</p></blockquote>",
